---
title: "party_transfer (Sui Framework: transfer)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_party: assert party.is_single_owner()
    q_check_party --> q_abort: not single owner
    q_abort --> [*]: abort EInvalidPartyPermissions
    q_check_party --> q_decompose: single owner
    q_decompose --> q_native: (default, addresses, permissions) = party.into_native()
    q_native --> [*]: party_transfer_impl(obj, default, addresses, permissions)

    note right of q_check_party
        INV-001: currently limited to single-owner parties
        INV-002: party objects use consensus (not fast path)
        INV-003: party_transfer restricted to defining module (bytecode verifier)
        INV-004: public_party_transfer requires key + store
    end note
